<title>USA: SEMCO Energy Inc Q1 net, revenues rise.</title>
<headline>SEMCO Energy Inc Q1 net, revenues rise.</headline>
<dateline>PORT HURON, Mich. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	     1996</p>
<p> Total Operating Revenues	   $252,735,000   $176,128,000</p>
<p>   Gas Distribution Margin	    25,519,000     26,438,000</p>
<p>   Gas Marketing Margin		  5,264,000	1,689,000</p>
<p>   Transportation Revenue		3,952,000	3,518,000</p>
<p> Operating Income			 12,741,000     11,859,000</p>
<p> Other Income (Loss), Net		   79,000	(274,000)</p>
<p> Net Income				  9,589,000	8,742,000</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share*			     .77		.71</p>
<p> Dividends Per Share*			    .20		.19</p>
<p>Average Common Shares Outstanding*</p>
<p>NOTE: SEMCO Energy Inc, formerly Southeastern Michigan Gas Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>*Adjusted to give retroactive effect to five percent stock dividend in May 1996.  Per share amounts and average shares outstanding do not reflect the five percent stock dividend payable in May 1997.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
